 'TTG-1-033':['突襲','UA56BT/TTG-1-033 アークグレン green2/AP1 field/gen1/COLOR. While ACTIVE, generated energy +1. When a card named exactly アークグレンラガン raids, this field may move facedown under it and draw 2, once per printed name. The controller chooses witness timing. TTG-1-026 can add this exact name. The Chinese effect sentence does not describe the COLOR life; the shared handler deploys one green hand character of required energy 2 or less and AP 1. Scenario tests exist. Not full official FAQ certification.'],
