 'TTG-1-061':['カミナ','UA56BT/TTG-1-061 ニア red3/AP2/BP2000/gen2/DRAW. Mutual entry ban with カミナ. On play choose 1 mode, or 2 different modes when the own deck has 20 or fewer cards. Recover a シモン of required energy 2 or less from outside, or ACTIVE-deploy a red シモン of required energy 2 or less from hand. Mode order is not forced recover-then-deploy. A deployed Simon runs its onPlay. DRAW life is the shared handler. Scenario tests exist. Not full official FAQ certification.'],
 'TTG-1-062':['REST','UA56BT/TTG-1-062 ニア red3/AP1/BP2500/gen2/COLOR. Mutual entry ban with カミナ. On play, may replay one own field シモン of required energy 3 or less that already has an onPlay program, without moving it or spending AP. MAIN, only while READY and the deck has 20 or fewer cards: REST self, give a シモン or a Simon raid base BP+1000 this turn, and may discard 1 to set that character ACTIVE. The Chinese effect sentence does not describe the COLOR life; the shared handler retires one opponent front of BP 2500 or less. Scenario tests exist. Not full official FAQ certification.'],
